  "content": "\n\n<p>(臨時標誌)</p>\n<p>使用 BlueMap 時，為了讓動態樹（Dynamic Trees）的枝椏能正確渲染，我將原本的枝椏模型替換成了 Minecraft 標準的六面木頭模型。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>我會根據請求持續新增與更新此資源包，歡迎隨時留言。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>進行中：無</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>目前相容的模組：</p>\n<p>Autumnity</p>\n<p>Biomes'o'Plenty</p>\n<p>Ecologics</p>\n<p>Nature's Aura</p>\n<p>Neopolitan</p>\n<p>Quark</p>\n<p>Vamparism</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>祝您遊玩愉快！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mcCxzuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Discord-logo.png\" alt=\"discord\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></a><br><br>點擊下方圖片，即可取得便宜且可靠的伺服器託管服務！<a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-weight:400\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d776\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/698115/description_5136b3ef-2285-459e-91c4-7bde7e032d16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"845\" height=\"300\"></a></p>",
